From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Description: Require CMake 3.16, so CMake 4 configures the tree
 CMake 4 removed compatibility with versions older than 3.5 and stops at
 cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8.12) with "Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has
 been removed from CMake". The same change KDE made in oxygen-gtk (a8798db8,
 Nicolas Fella, "Raise minimum CMake version to 3.16").
Forwarded: not-needed, the tree is in KDE's unmaintained group
Last-Update: 2026-11-23
---
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 project(OxygenFont)
 set(PROJECT_VERSION "5.4.3")
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.8.12)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.16)
 
 find_package(ECM 1.2.0 REQUIRED NO_MODULE)
 
